@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Flushed_Open1,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……私がこの鍵を<br>手に入れたのは、<br>懲罰房の中よ。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Eyes1_Uncomfortable_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:私が今日<br>懲罰房に行ったのは<br>【２０時過ぎ】……。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Eyes1_Normal_Open4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:遠野ハンナたちが<br>去ったのを確認して、<br>入れ違いで<br>懲罰房へと入ったわ。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:わたくしたちの事、<br>見てたんですの……！？|#0102Trial04_Hanna001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Eyes1_Uncomfortable_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ええ。<br>何やら騒がしかったのも<br>あってね。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Eyes1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:私が懲罰房の扉を開けた時、<br>鍵はかかっていなかったわ。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Eyes1_Neutral_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そうして私が<br>部屋に入ると……<br>すでに佐伯ミリアは<br>血まみれの死体に<br>なっていた。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:じゃあナノカさんは<br>【２１時】に発見する<br>よりも前に死体を<br>発見していたって<br>事ですね！|#0102Trial04_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL10,Eyes1_Normal_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そういうことね。<br>私は中に入って、<br>血まみれの佐伯ミリアの<br>脈をとって<br>死亡を確認したわ。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL9,Eyes1_Normal_Open3,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:この【鍵】が<br>懲罰房の床に落ちているのを<br>見つけたのもその時。<br>扉の錠前に入れてみたら、<br>鍵をかけることができた……。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Surprised,ArmR8_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Pensive_Open2,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:じゃあ部屋に<br>鍵をかけたのは……。|#0102Trial04_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1,ArmR2,
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:私よ。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Surprised1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:なんでそんなこと……！|#0102Trial04_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Normal_Closed1,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:鍵を持っているのは<br>ゴクチョーや看守<br>……運営のはず。<br>だったら私たちの中に<br>犯人はいない。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka010| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL10,Eyes1_Normal_Open1,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:だから、<br>わかりやすくしただけよ。<br>私たちが<br>一致団結できるようにね。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka011| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Gross_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ただの嘘つきじゃん！<br>……今のも<br>口から出任せかも<br>しんないし！|#0102Trial04_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Uncomfortable_Open1,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……どちらにせよ、<br>私が本当の<br>第一発見者な時点で<br>一番の容疑者である事は<br>免れないでしょうね。|#0102Trial04_Nanoka012| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Eyes1_Angry_Open1,Mouth1_Angry_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"けど私が見たとき<br>すでに<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_04_01\">佐伯ミリア</link>は<br>死んでいた。<br>そして<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_04_02\">落ちていた鍵をかけた</link>の。<br>……<link=\"Objection_01_02_04_03\">何かおかしい</link>かしら？|#0102Trial04_Nanoka013|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:大ありだっての！<br>コイツ！<br>その、あの……！|#0102Trial04_Coco002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

