@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:……嘘つき！！|#0102Trial04_Coco003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

